## Results Directory Management ##############################################
#
# This is the core logic:
# 1. Ignore the entire contents of the results directory by default.
#    This will ignore all the heavy .vtu, .pvtu, .problem, etc. files.
results/

# 2. BUT, do NOT ignore the final .png image files inside any subdirectory.
#    The '!' negates the previous ignore rule for this specific pattern.
#    The '**/' is a special glob that matches all subdirectories recursively.
!results/**/*.png

# 3. (Optional but good practice) Also, do not ignore .gitkeep files.
#    This allows you to commit an empty directory structure if you need to,
#    by placing an empty file named ".gitkeep" inside a folder.
!results/**/.gitkeep